    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... it doesn't feel like something a professional can \"fix.\" it feels more like a law of physics. like if you know a storm is coming because of the way the pressure is dropping, you don't try to \"talk\" the storm away. you just accept that it's part of the environment. i'm just tired of fighting a battle that was decided before i was even born. it feels so futile.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
