      "content": "It's understandable to feel that way when the burden feels so massive and inescapable. Sometimes, accepting the inevitability of difficult things can feel like surrender, but it can also be a starting point for recognizing where you *can* exert control. Instead of fighting the whole storm, what if you could focus on finding a small, sheltered place within yourself for right now? Even tiny moments of peace can change the way you experience the inevitable.",
      "source": "target",
